> Observed subset result

Validation selected epoch 14, the last epoch: validation NLL 2.161372, inference training NLL
1.896855 and test NLL 2.198321; 13/64 test predictions are correct (20.3125%).
This small-data result does not establish A1 superiority over B1 or other mobile models.

> Native confusion matrices

These matrices use the held-out predictions from the executed program above.
The native `ConfusionMatrix` SVG API labels exact counts with true classes
running from top to bottom and predicted classes from left to right.

\image(figures/mnasnet_confusion_api_0.svg)
