\alttext(Integer prediction counts with true classes as rows and predicted classes as columns.)


> Conclusion

Decoded tables expose the released architecture without hiding a search or training loop.
Tensor SE/depthwise blocks, complete model counts and a visible full-A1 Adam fit connect
the design to executable calculations. Small-data accuracy and MACs do not measure mobile latency.

